# 🔍 断言和验证规范

## 常用断言模式

### DOM 元素断言
```typescript
// 存在性验证
expect(wrapper.find('[data-testid="element"]').exists()).toBe(true)
expect(wrapper.get('[data-testid="element"]')).toBeTruthy()

// 文本内容验证
expect(wrapper.text()).toContain('预期文本')
expect(wrapper.get('[data-testid="element"]').text()).toBe('确切文本')

// 属性验证
expect(wrapper.attributes('class')).toContain('expected-class')
expect(wrapper.get('input').attributes('disabled')).toBeDefined()

// 样式验证
expect(wrapper.classes()).toContain('active')
expect(wrapper.classes('disabled')).toBe(true)
```

### 事件断言
```typescript
// 事件触发验证
expect(wrapper.emitted()).toHaveProperty('custom-event')
expect(wrapper.emitted('custom-event')).toHaveLength(1)
expect(wrapper.emitted('custom-event')?.[0]).toEqual(['payload'])

// 事件处理器验证
const mockHandler = vi.fn()
wrapper = createWrapper({ onCustomEvent: mockHandler })
await wrapper.get('[data-testid="trigger"]').trigger('click')
expect(mockHandler).toHaveBeenCalledWith('expected-args')
```

### 响应式数据断言
```typescript
// 状态变化验证
expect(reactiveState.value).toBe('expected-value')
expect(computedValue.value).toBe('computed-result')

// 异步状态验证
await nextTick()
expect(asyncState.value).toBe('async-result')
```

